# Wiki
- Pages: `Home`, `Doc-` (only what works in `main`), `Epic-`/`Feature-` (in progress), `Plan-` only for current Vision + Roadmap (obsolete Plan-MVP pages stay deleted; roadmap must reflect reality — big MVP, operators table), `_Sidebar`, `_Footer`. No team rules in the wiki.
- Placement: normative and product docs live only in `.cursor/`, `AGENTS.md`, and this wiki. Do not keep a parallel repo `docs/` tree for conventions, product TZ, research, or one-off artifacts.
- Unprovable `Doc-` claim: move to `Plan-` or drop; unverified: «требует проверки» + issue link.
- Writers: analyst and architect; tester only feature «Тест-кейсы»; others send text via issue/PR.
- Impersonal Russian by default (what the system does: «Gateway отвечает 404»): no personal names, no role labels as people, no agent or role as the actor, no «я/мы сделали». When clarity needs it, name Cursor Automations. No customer company names. Simple example first; public sources (e.g. Tourvisor) may be cited; links to `#81`, `PR #82` welcome. Dates `2026-10-17`, no «Обновлено» line.
- Names Latin `Doc-Название-Через-Дефис.md`, first line `# <русский заголовок>`; links `[текст](Имя-Файла)`; ADR `Doc-ADR-NNN-Название`, numbers never reused.
- `Epic-`/`Feature-` pages from `Epic-Template`/`Feature-Template`, sidebar group «Фичи». Two page types only. A small analysis is a `Feature-` page. `Plan-` pages in group «Планы» only for Vision + Roadmap (no new MVP plan pages; obsolete Plan-MVP stay deleted).
- «Бизнес и сценарии» meets `playbook-step-01-analysis.mdc` for that page's route before «Архитектура» is written. Epic route: why, for whom, named analogues, end-to-end scenarios, high-level contour; no field catalog. Every epic, including a backlog or bugs epic, uses that route. Feature route: justify every field or block (UI or backend) and the layout when a screen is proposed. «Полное ТЗ» is steps 1-4 on the feature page (`playbook-workflow.mdc`). The epic page is not a screen TZ and does not unlock feature code. Templates stay on the wiki; their short bullets are a skeleton, not the step 1 bar. Do not copy the templates into the repo. A wiki template that still names another analysis level is stale: follow this rule.
- Shipped: `Doc-` (+ ADR), source page marked «сделано» with links. Cancelled: «отменено» with reason. Doc vs code mismatch: fix the wiki if code is right, else open an issue.
- Sidebar updated in the same commit as any new/renamed/deleted page; rename updates all links (external: stub «Страница перенесена: ...»).
- Before push: `git pull --rebase`; sidebar/links checked; `playbook-security.mdc` checks. Commit `документация(вики): ...` with «Зачем»/«Как работает».
- No `skills-lock.json` or third-party agent skill packs in this repo; skills live in the owner global Cursor/agent setup.
